       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SPUROPT.
       AUTHOR.         CA YODER.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   SEPTEMBER 1995.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SPUROPT         PURCHASING MENU PROGRAM                 *
      *                                                            *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO LOAD MISCELLANEOUS             *
      *D    PURCHASING INFORMATION.                                *
      *D                                                           *
      *D    SUBPROGRAMS CALLED :                                   *
      *D                                                           *
      *D           1.  SPCSEDI   ---  EDI OPTIONS                  *
      *D           2.  SPCSISO   ---  ISO-9000 QUESTIONS           *
      *D           3.  SPCSUOM   ---  UNIT OF MEASURE              *
      *D           4.  SPCSINST  ---  STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS        *
      *D           5.  SPCSQUOT  ---  QUOTE INFORMATION            *
      *D           6.  SPCSFLLW  ---  STANDARD FOLLOWUP INSTR.     *
      *D           7.  SPCSBYCD  ---  BUYER CODE INFORMATION       *
      *D           8.  SPCSFOB   ---  FOB CODES                    *
      *D           9.  SPCSTAX   ---  TAX DISTRICTS                *
      *D          10.  SPCSCURR  ---  CURRENCY CODE MENU           *
      *D          11.  SPCSTRAN  ---  TERMS OF DELIVERY/TRANSPORT  *
      *D          12.  SPCSPAYT  ---  PAYMENT TERMS                *
      *D          13.  SPCSSHIP  ---  SHIP DATE QUESTIONS          *
      *D          14.  SPCSPURO  ---  PURCHASING USER OPTIONS      *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                   ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSTARTUP-SI
                   ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                   ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                   FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                   CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC             PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1        PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2        PIC X VALUE SPACE.

       01  INVOICE-IND                   PIC X(1)  VALUE "N" .
           88  INVOICE-IND-ON                      VALUE "Y".
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       COPY MPLTINFO   IN COPYLIB.
       01  MPLTINFO-ARG                    PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
       COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                    PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                           PIC Z(11)9.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       01  MAIN-MENU-SCREEN.
           05  BUYER-INFORMATION         PIC X(1).
           05  CURRENCY-CODES            PIC X(1).
           05  EDI-QUESTION              PIC X(1).
           05  FOB-CODES                 PIC X(1).
           05  PAYMENT-TERMS             PIC X(1).
           05  TAX-DISTRICTS             PIC X(1).
           05  UNITS-OF-MEASURE          PIC X(1).
           05  QUOTE-INFO                PIC X(1).
           05  STANDARD-INSTR            PIC X(1).
           05  ISO-QUESTION              PIC X(1).
           05  SHIP-DATE-QUES            PIC X(1).
           05  USER-OPTS                 PIC X(1).
           05  PO-DEL-QUESTION           PIC X(1).
           05  STND-FLLOWUP              PIC X(1).
           05  TERMS-OF-TRANSPORT        PIC X(1).
           05  MM-CMDLINE                PIC X(79).
           05  MM-MSGLINE                PIC X(79).


       01  PO-DELETE-SCREEN.
           05  PO-DEL-MONTHS             PIC 9(2).
           05  HIST-DEL-MONTHS           PIC 9(2).
           05  INVOICE-SYS-IND           PIC X(1).
      *    05  PO-DEL-MSGLINE            PIC X(79).
           05  PD-CMDLINE                PIC X(79).
           05  PD-MSGLINE                PIC X(79).

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
       COPY VCOMLINK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGSUB    IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION   USING BASE,
                                  VIEW-COMAREA,
                                  LANGUAGE-PARMS.

       MAIN-PGM SECTION 01.

       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           MOVE "SPUROPT" TO BU-PGM-NAME.

       2-EOJ.
            CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
            GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.


      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *                  6 - M A I N                   *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "PURCH1" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES TO MAIN-MENU-SCREEN.

       6-MAIN-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE MAIN-MENU-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC      TO MAIN-MENU-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MM-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-MAIN-SHOW-FORM.

           IF ISO-QUESTION = "X"
               CALL "SPCSISO" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF EDI-QUESTION = "X"
               CALL "SPCSEDI" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF BUYER-INFORMATION = "X"
               CALL "SPCSBYCD" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF UNITS-OF-MEASURE = "X"
               CALL "SPCSUOM" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF CURRENCY-CODES = "X"
               CALL "SPCSCURR" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF TERMS-OF-TRANSPORT = "X"
               CALL "SPCSTRAN" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF PAYMENT-TERMS = "X"
               CALL "SPCSPAYT" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF FOB-CODES = "X"
               CALL "SPCSFOB" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF PO-DEL-QUESTION = "X"
               PERFORM 61-PO-DEL THRU 61-PO-DEL-X
           ELSE
           IF STND-FLLOWUP = "X"
               CALL "SPCSFLLW" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF SHIP-DATE-QUES = "X"
               CALL "SPCSSHIP" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF USER-OPTS = "X"
               CALL "SPCSPURO" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF STANDARD-INSTR = "X"
               CALL "SPCSINST" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF TAX-DISTRICTS = "X"
               CALL "SPCSTAX" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
           IF QUOTE-INFO = "X"
               CALL "SPCSQUOT" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************
      **       PURCHASE ORDER DELETE INFORMATION          **
      ******************************************************
       61-PO-DEL.
           MOVE "PODELT" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       61-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO PO-DELETE-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 611-READ-MPLTINFO.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
      *    MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
      *    MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
      *    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
      *    MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO PO-DEL-MSGLINE.

       61-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE PO-DELETE-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC      TO PO-DELETE-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 61-PO-DEL-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO PD-MSGLINE
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-EDIT-CHECKS.
           IF INVOICE-IND-ON
               IF INVOICE-SYS-IND NOT = "Y"
      ****         INVOICE SYS. INDICATOR MUST BE EQUAL TO "Y" AFTER
      ****              BEING SET TO "Y"               *****************
                   MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  63 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO PD-MSGLINE
                   MOVE B"1" TO IND(5), IND(99)
                   GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PODL" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE PO-DEL-MONTHS   TO MPLTINFO-PO-DEL-MTH
               MOVE INVOICE-SYS-IND TO MPLTINFO-INVOICE-IND
               MOVE HIST-DEL-MONTHS TO MPLTINFO-PO-HIST-DEL-MTH
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE "PODL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES          TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PODL"          TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE PO-DEL-MONTHS   TO MPLTINFO-PO-DEL-MTH
               MOVE INVOICE-SYS-IND TO MPLTINFO-INVOICE-IND
               MOVE HIST-DEL-MONTHS TO MPLTINFO-PO-HIST-DEL-MTH
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "WRT MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE "PODL" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "PODL" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       61-PO-DEL-X.
           EXIT.

       611-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PODL" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-DEL-MTH  TO PO-DEL-MONTHS
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-HIST-DEL-MTH TO HIST-DEL-MONTHS
               MOVE MPLTINFO-INVOICE-IND TO INVOICE-SYS-IND
               IF MPLTINFO-INVOICE-IND = "Y"
                   MOVE "Y" TO INVOICE-IND
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 611-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "PODL" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
      *********************************************************
       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
